  ('coding', 'Operators', 1, 'What does this code print?', array['13.33 2', '2 13', '13 2', '13 3'], 2, 'With whole numbers, / drops the fraction and % gives the remainder: 80 = 13 × 6 + 2. It prints 13 2.', 40, 'coding-div-mod', '2fe16c6f9a9160a7', '{"c":"int a = 80;\nint b = 6;\nprintf(\"%d \", a / b);\nprintf(\"%d \", a % b);","cpp":"int a = 80;\nint b = 6;\ncout << (a / b) << \" \";\ncout << (a % b) << \" \";","java":"int a = 80;\nint b = 6;\nSystem.out.print((a / b) + \" \");\nSystem.out.print((a % b) + \" \");","python":"a = 80\nb = 6\nprint(a // b, end=\" \")\nprint(a % b, end=\" \")","pseudo":"// \"/\" is integer division: 7 / 2 = 3\n\nInteger a = 80\nInteger b = 6\nprint a / b\nprint a mod b"}'::jsonb),
